* RSpice standard device library
* Generic models for the parity examples. Values are textbook-level defaults,
* not vendor data; replace with vendor cards for production work.

* ── Diodes ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.model D1N4148 D(IS=2.682n N=1.836 RS=0.5664 CJO=3.78p VJ=0.75 M=0.333 TT=11.5n BV=100 IBV=100u EG=1.11 XTI=3)
.model D1N4007 D(IS=7.023n N=1.8 RS=0.03389 CJO=15p VJ=0.75 M=0.333 TT=5u BV=1000 IBV=5u)
.model DLED D(IS=1e-20 N=1.8 RS=10 CJO=50p VJ=3 M=0.5 BV=5)

* ── MOSFETs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.model NMOS1 NMOS(LEVEL=1 KP=110u VTO=0.7 LAMBDA=0.02 GAMMA=0.4 PHI=0.7 TOX=9n CGSO=2n CGDO=2n CGBO=0.2n)
.model PMOS1 PMOS(LEVEL=1 KP=50u VTO=-0.7 LAMBDA=0.02 GAMMA=0.4 PHI=0.7 TOX=9n CGSO=2n CGDO=2n CGBO=0.2n)

* ── Switches and passives ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.model SW1 SW(RON=1 ROFF=100meg VT=0.5 VH=0.1)
.model RMETAL R(R=1 TC1=4e-3 TC2=0)
.model CCOG C(C=1 TC1=30e-6 TC2=0)
.model LAIR L(L=1 TC1=0 TC2=0)

* ── Common subcircuits ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
* Voltage divider: `X1 in out mid divider r1=10k r2=10k`
.subckt divider top bottom mid PARAMS: r1=10k r2=10k
Rtop top mid {r1}
Rbot mid bottom {r2}
.ends divider

* RC low-pass: `X1 in out lp r=1k c=100n`
.subckt lowpass in out PARAMS: r=1k c=100n
R1 in out {r}
C1 out 0 {c}
.ends lowpass
